---
import Base from "../layouts/Base.astro";
---

<Base
  title="Terms of Use"
  description="GTAVI.AI terms of use — community data project, intellectual property notices, and disclaimer of affiliation with Rockstar Games and Take-Two Interactive."
>
  <div class="max-w-3xl mx-auto px-4 sm:px-6 py-16">

    <div class="text-[10px] font-mono text-zinc-600 uppercase tracking-[0.2em] mb-3">// Legal</div>
    <h1 class="text-3xl font-bold text-white mb-2">Terms of Use</h1>
    <p class="text-[11px] font-mono text-zinc-600 mb-10">Last updated: May 2026</p>

    <div class="flex flex-col gap-8 text-sm text-zinc-400 leading-relaxed">

      <section>
        <h2 class="text-[11px] font-mono text-zinc-300 uppercase tracking-widest mb-3">1. Community Data Project</h2>
        <p>
          GTAVI.AI is an independent, community-driven data and analytics project. It is not affiliated with,
          endorsed by, or in any way connected to Rockstar Games, Take-Two Interactive, or any of their
          subsidiaries or affiliates. All predictions, analysis, and data presented on this site are
          community-derived and should be treated as informed estimates, not official information.
        </p>
      </section>

      <section>
        <h2 class="text-[11px] font-mono text-zinc-300 uppercase tracking-widest mb-3">2. Intellectual Property</h2>
        <p>
          Grand Theft Auto, GTA VI, GTA Online, GTA V, and all related titles, logos, characters,
          locations, and game assets are trademarks and © of Rockstar Games / Take-Two Interactive
          Software, Inc. All rights reserved. Use of game imagery, screenshots, and trailer stills
          on this site is for informational and commentary purposes under fair use principles.
        </p>
      </section>

      <section>
        <h2 class="text-[11px] font-mono text-zinc-300 uppercase tracking-widest mb-3">3. Accuracy and Predictions</h2>
        <p>
          Predictions and forecasts published on GTAVI.AI are based on publicly available data,
          historical franchise analysis, and community research. They carry no guarantee of accuracy
          and may not reflect official plans. Confidence scores are our own internal methodology —
          they are not endorsements or official statements.
        </p>
      </section>

      <section>
        <h2 class="text-[11px] font-mono text-zinc-300 uppercase tracking-widest mb-3">4. Data Sources</h2>
        <p>
          Economic and financial data is sourced from publicly accessible APIs and databases including
          Steam, YouTube, SEC EDGAR, Yahoo Finance, Google Trends, and community-maintained datasets.
          We do not claim ownership of source data. Chart data is updated nightly via automated scrapers.
        </p>
      </section>

      <section>
        <h2 class="text-[11px] font-mono text-zinc-300 uppercase tracking-widest mb-3">5. No Warranty</h2>
        <p>
          This site is provided "as is" without warranty of any kind. We make no representations about
          the completeness, accuracy, or suitability of the information for any purpose. Use of this
          site is at your own risk.
        </p>
      </section>

      <section>
        <h2 class="text-[11px] font-mono text-zinc-300 uppercase tracking-widest mb-3">6. Changes</h2>
        <p>
          These terms may be updated at any time without notice. Continued use of the site constitutes
          acceptance of the current terms.
        </p>
      </section>

      <div class="border-t border-border-dim pt-6">
        <p class="text-[11px] font-mono text-zinc-600">
          Questions? Contact us via the community channels linked on the site.
        </p>
      </div>

    </div>
  </div>
</Base>
